    "updated_at": "2018-01-28T06:44:57Z",
    "body": "> Is that why it was deemed that none implemented the step?\r\n\r\nNo \"advisory information\" is meant to only affect the tooltip (and equivalent UI in AT or elsewhere), nothing else. Since they all display the title of the parent `<div>`, the step is skipped.\r\n\r\nGiven the limited exposure in AT it probably does not affect them, but we should maybe add a section with some advice around the attribute, given it's limited utility to all users. My suggestion would be that we track that in a new issue. @domenic?",
